# tally 2.2.1 P43 S2 and S3 (L §8.2): a read of one fact of movements stated same holds what both sides gave for
# that fact only: the fee lists no pin of the cash amount; a count reads the days for membership and lists
# every side's day pins (review g2fix same/s2_leg_reads). Before W10: fee_a2 listed pinned: a2.
=== s2_leg_reads.tally
model s2
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place bankfee: outside lives 1900-01-01..
kind feed: event certain
  leg cash: PLN
  leg fee: PLN
input a1: money PLN
input a2: money PLN
input fe: money PLN
input d1: date
input d2: date
move in1: feed
  on d1
  leg cash from world to konto amount a1
  leg fee from konto to bankfee amount fe
move in2: feed
  on d2
  leg cash from world to konto amount a2
  leg fee from konto to bankfee amount fe
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  a1 = 100.00 PLN "s"
  a2 = 100.00 PLN "s"
  fe = 1.00 PLN "s"
  d1 = 2026-03-05 "s"
  d2 = 2026-03-05 "s"
  same in1 = in2
ask fee0: sum(m.fee.amount for m in feed over 2026-03)
ask fee_a2: sum(m.fee.amount for m in feed over 2026-03) with a2 = 130.00 PLN
ask cash_a2: sum(m.cash.amount for m in feed over 2026-03) with a2 = 130.00 PLN
ask cnt_d2: count(m in feed over 2026-03) with d2 = 2026-03-20
ask cnt_d2x: count(m in feed over 2026-03) with d2 = 2026-04-20
ask day_a2: m.day for m in feed over 2026-03 with a2 = 130.00 PLN
ask day_d2: m.day for m in feed over 2026-03 with d2 = 2026-03-20
ask fl_a2: flows(in1.cash, 2026-03) with a2 = 130.00 PLN
ask bal_d2: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) with d2 = 2026-03-20
ask bal_a2: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) with a2 = 130.00 PLN
ask x_fee: explain bal(konto, 2026-03-31) with a2 = 130.00 PLN
ask fl_fee: flows(in1.fee, 2026-03) with a2 = 130.00 PLN
=== expect fee_a2 fl_fee cnt_d2 cnt_d2x day_a2
fee_a2: 1.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-01
fl_fee: 1.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-01
cnt_d2: 1
  pinned: d2 = 2026-03-20
  cut 2026-01-01
cnt_d2x: ?"in1 and in2 are one, but the day of cash differs on 2026-03-05: 2026-03-05 (in1) and 2026-04-20 (in2)" (in1, in2)
  pinned: d2 = 2026-04-20
  cut 2026-01-01
day_a2 (m = in1): 2026-03-05
  cut 2026-01-01
